--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
clangd
  Version:  23.1.0
  Upstream: https://github.com/clangd/clangd (an LLVM project distribution)
  License:  Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions
  Location: <payload>/clangd/, license text at <payload>/licenses/LLVM-LICENSE.TXT

libc++ and libc++abi (LLVM's C++ standard library)
  Version:  23.1.0
  Upstream: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project (runtimes/libcxx, runtimes/libcxxabi)
  License:  Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions
  Location: headers and module sources under <payload>/kit/, license text at
            <payload>/kit/licenses/LLVM-LICENSE.TXT
  Note:     data only — headers and precompiled module sources, nothing is compiled into the
            payload from this source.

llvm-mingw (win32-x64 kit only)
  Version:  20260826 (built on LLVM 23.1.0), UCRT, Linux x86_64 host build
  Upstream: https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw
  License:  Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions (LLVM/libc++ parts);
